# help/

Documentation for Cdsync commands and concepts. Covers venture creation, design brief assembly, drop handling (install vs import), validation, and microsite generation.

## Files

- `cdsync.md` -- Architecture and command loop overview for the design system workflow
- `new.md` -- Scaffold a new venture with design system skeleton
- `init.md` -- Initialize a design system in an existing repository
- `bootstrap.md` -- Generate `BOOTSTRAP-CD.md` for Claude Design projects
- `brief.md` -- Assemble the design brief from venture facts and spec library
- `install.md` -- Replace the target with an as-is Claude Design drop (whole tree)
- `import.md` -- Merge a Claude Design drop into the target (subset only)
- `check.md` -- Validate drop against specifications and compute metrics
- `site.md` -- Generate and serve the design system microsite
- `doctor.md` -- Verify installation, dependencies, and spec library integrity
- `release.md` -- Version management and release ceremony
